<article class="entry" id="safety-ml">
  <span class="tag">NSF-sponsored project</span>
  <h3>Machine learning for roadway safety performance modeling</h3>
  <p class="meta"><span class="venue">Fall 2023</span></p>
  <p>Processed 20 years of crash data for 67 counties and trained ensemble (XGBoost) and statistical (negative binomial) models on more than 100 variables to predict crash frequency. Sponsored by NSF grant CMMI-1749200.</p>
